{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>And they shall make themselves tzitzit.</b> On account of the threads that hang from it, as in ״וַיִּקָּחֵנִי בְּצִיצִת רֹאשִׁי״ (Ezekiel 8) (Menachot 42). Another interpretation: <b>tzitzit</b> — on account of ״וּרְאִיתֶם אֹתוֹ״, as in ״מֵצִיץ מִן הַחֲרַכִּים״ (Song of Songs 2)." "<b>Tekhelet.</b> A green color of the ḥilazon."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:08.054558311Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}